{"ID":"20240513083202-n4ug9cr","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083202-n4ug9cr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083202-n4ug9cr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513150716-4ifys8i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513150716-4ifys8i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513150716-4ifys8i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:627,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:627\u0026#125;","title":"176","type":"doc","updated":"20240514134606"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513150716-4ifys8i","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1024px;","id":"20240513150716-4ifys8i","updated":"20240514134606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/06"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"155-2 B, S"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Female"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"18  身材好"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/20"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"憂鬱症回診"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n服前方後"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"情緒："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心情愉快，不會悲傷沮喪，今日不會焦慮。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"足溫："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足仍冷 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→假如足溫，睡時不需棉被蓋腳，蓋腳反而覺得熱；若需蓋腳則為足冷。有看過熊鹿或兔子等動物在野地穿鞋子嗎？因為牠們的腳是熱的，動物沒有醫生照顧也有沒有注射疫苗，依然能夠養育健康的下一代。西醫希望人們生病，如此藥廠才能賺大錢。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"體力："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好轉。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，味覺好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 手涼額熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 睡覺時身體無特別感到寒熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"盜汗："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾有一次，近來沒有。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"緩有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡紅白"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瞳孔反應好；肝脾區混在一起，如同木頭被砍後打碎與泥土和在一起； 肝區有白紋，稍混濁。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 進步中，腎陽好轉，肝積毒素仍有。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方：   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同5/6方                      "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伍付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9 → 3碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※治療至手溫額涼時，方可停止湯劑"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎臟控制聽覺、記憶、髮質，而且腎臟功能強大，就不會害怕任何事，能控制情緒，不易焦慮憂鬱，因腎藏志，人會有企圖心，有志氣，想要立志做大事，例如做美國總統。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台北一知名精神科醫師自己服用抗憂鬱藥，結果跳樓自殺。服用抗憂鬱藥容易有幻覺，幻想自己像鳥一般能飛，結果從高處摔下而死。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥能調和肝脾，使人愉快，因其肝中仍有毒素積存，為穩定療效，續服前方。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人體就像地球一樣，海平面越高氣溫便越低，海平面越低溫度便越高，所以頭為人體高處，額溫要涼，腳為人體低處，足溫要熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"備註："}]}]}]}]}